      "html": "<h2>Welcome to Syracuse</h2><p>Here are a few things to know about Syracuse, Syracuse University and the community around it.</p><p>You can <strong>Scroll</strong> or click <strong>Next</strong> above to continue, or switch to <strong>Explore</strong> to jump between locations and pan or zoom freely.</p>",
