      "lng": -76.13506259108851,
      "zoom": 16.137824034443934,
      "html": "<p>Here, you can see the whole university and its main buildings. The JMA Wireless Dome (formerly Carrier Dome, which many still call it) is at the southwest corner of the university. The Newhouse School is at the northwest corner.</p>",
