    {
      "id": "location-6",
      "lat": 43.047423041123835,
      "lng": -76.15490880170137,
      "zoom": 17.321828251724423,
      "html": "<p>Armory Square is a hopping location with lots of shops and restaurants. Historically, it was a bustling 19th-century rail hub and industrial district, but it fell into deep decline in the mid-20th century as manufacturing moved out and storefronts sat abandoned. </p><p>Starting in the 1980s, a targeted revitalization movement converted the neighborhood's brick warehouses into apartments, local boutiques, and restaurants.</p>",
      "flyTransition": "smooth",
      "overlays": {
        "geojson": {
          "type": "FeatureCollection",
          "features": [
            {
              "type": "Feature",
